      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "COMMISSIONER (4) could manage only third at Sale last time but caught the eye when clocking a handy 24.40 over 435m at Sale the start prior. Can return to winning form here if runs up to time two back. RELAX MATE (3) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by 1.4 lengths at Horsham in a handy 23.55 beating Trissa Bale. Solid formlines coming through his last run. Can go close again if runs up to latest figure. TOKYO ROMANCE (1) was below best last time at Shepparton (22.81) in a Grade 4/5, finishing a 11 length eighth. Has three wins already from this draw. Looks one of the chances. NANGAR MACIE (2) can sneak into the finish.",
